#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:1
msgid "教程：导入测量点集"
msgstr "Tutorial: Import a measured point set"

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:3
msgid "测量点集是评估区域的最常见来源。v0.1 只接受规范 SI 源文件，所有数值必须是有限的 float64。"
msgstr "Measured point sets are the most common source of an evaluation region. v0.1 accepts only canonical SI source artifacts, and every numeric value must be a finite float64."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:5
msgid "CSV 点集"
msgstr "CSV point sets"

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:7
msgid "CSV 的头部和列顺序是固定的："
msgstr "The CSV header and column order are fixed:"

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:13
msgid "`point_id` 非空且唯一；坐标和权重有限；权重必须为正。坐标单位是米，坐标框架在构建定义的 `region.frame` 里显式声明——CSV 文件本身不写框架。"
msgstr "`point_id` is non-empty and unique; coordinates and weights are finite and weights must be positive. Coordinates are in metres, and the coordinate frame is declared explicitly in the build definition's `region.frame`; the CSV itself does not carry a frame."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:22
msgid "HDF5 与 VTK 族变体"
msgstr "HDF5 and VTK-family variants"

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:24
msgid "HDF5 根数据集为 `point_ids`、`points_m`、`weights`，根属性为 `coordinate_frame` 和 `length_unit=m`。"
msgstr "HDF5 root datasets are `point_ids`, `points_m`, and `weights`, with root attributes `coordinate_frame` and `length_unit=m`."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:25
msgid "VTK 族把坐标存为网格点，点数据 `weight` 附在点上；身份用标量 `point_id`，或无损的 `point_id_utf8` 加 `point_id_length` 组合；框架仍由构建定义声明。"
msgstr "VTK-family point sets store coordinates as mesh points with point data `weight`; identity is scalar `point_id` or the lossless `point_id_utf8` plus `point_id_length` pair; the frame is still declared by the build definition."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:27
msgid "精确布局见[参考：格式契约](../reference/format-contracts)。"
msgstr "Exact layouts: [Reference: format contracts](../reference/format-contracts)."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:29
msgid "导入前检查清单"
msgstr "Checklist before importing"

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:31
msgid "坐标已经确定性转换为米，转换过程留在包外作为溯源记录。"
msgstr "Coordinates are already deterministically converted to metres, with the conversion kept outside the package as provenance."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:32
msgid "点 ID 唯一且稳定——后续所有响应文件都按这个 ID 顺序对齐。"
msgstr "Point IDs are unique and stable; every later response file aligns to this ID order."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:33
msgid "权重为正；如果你只想均匀评估，所有权重取 1 即可。"
msgstr "Weights are positive; use 1 everywhere for uniform evaluation."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:34
msgid "框架字符串拼写一致；框架是精确身份，不是描述文字。"
msgstr "Frame strings match exactly; a frame is an exact identity, not descriptive text."

#: ../../tutorials/import-point-set.md:36
msgid "导入后先在向导或 `inspect_build` 里审查点数、范围、顺序和权重，再进入正向模型步骤。"
msgstr "After import, review point count, extent, order, and weights in the wizard or `inspect_build` before moving to the forward-model step."
